cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "heavyhex-subsystem-code: a pre-registered d = 3 vs d = 5 memory experiment with the heavy-hex subsystem code on IBM Fez"
abstract: >-
  Code for a pre-registered memory experiment on IBM Fez: the heavy-hex
  subsystem code at d = 3 and d = 5, run side by side, to measure the
  error-suppression factor Λ = ε₃ / ε₅. It places both patches from IBM's
  daily calibration, translates the circuits to Fez's native gates, freezes
  a simulated prediction before the circuits are sent, and decodes and
  analyzes the shots against it.
authors:
